# Chief-action preparations for the catalogue in 13.5.21

The original K*V*-action supplies faithful section images of quadratic ratio
at most two. The marked irreducible plane maps equivariantly onto the moved
plane of every noncentral section. The full B.4.5 input is combined with the
corrected B.4.2 input, and the ten-dimensional SL₅(2) section is excluded using
the complete exterior-square/exterior-cube classification. The remaining model
exclusions, group recognition and natural-module recognition remain with this
branch's assembly.

Source: Aschbacher–Smith, combined manuscript of 1 March 2004,
13.5.21, printed pp.923–924 (PDF pp.940–941).
-/
